Muse must perform real visual inspection.

Capture meaningful views including:
- player-level spawn/initial experience;
- major forest;
- bunker approach;
- long-distance world view;
- landmark view;
- representative traversal route;
- any weak/problematic region.

Muse must inspect the actual visual evidence.

Specifically look for:
- flatness;
