- repeated assets;
- grid placement;
- unnatural tree spacing;
- obvious wedges;
- floating geometry;
- buried geometry;
- ugly silhouettes;
- empty ground;
- bad scale;
- excessive clutter;
- weak composition;
- bunker/terrain mismatch;
- bad lighting;
- insufficient atmospheric depth;
- Roblox prototype appearance.

If visually weak:
REJECT IT.
FIX IT.
CAPTURE AGAIN.
REVIEW AGAIN.

Do not manufacture VISUAL_QA=PASS.

